## Goal Model – Multi‑Robot Food Delivery & Dish Retrieval

Below is a complete goal‑model decomposition for the described multi‑robot system.  
All goals are numbered **G#** (depth‑first traversal).  
All tasks are numbered **AT#** (depth‑first traversal).  
Each node contains the required annotations, type, runtime operator, and justification.

---

